::  languages/glow/compiler/rye_emitter.glow -- Glow -> Compilable Rye!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  gate-emit-rye-fn
  |=  [arms-count=@ud max-arms=@ud]                     ::  bounded core arms
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  verified count
  ~|  'glow-rye-emitter-too-many-arms'                  ::  <= 64 core arms
  ?>  &(gte(arms-count 1) lte(arms-count max-arms))
  arms-count
--
